---
import SubpageLayout from '../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
import Checklist from '../components/Checklist.astro';
import PhotoCredit from '../components/PhotoCredit.astro';
---
<SubpageLayout
  title="Visiting Lake View Park in Rainy Weather"
  description="Visiting Lake View Park in rainy weather: path safety, activity suspensions, what to bring and when to postpone."
  path="/rainy-day-guide/"
  faq={[
    { q: 'Is Lake View Park open when it rains?', a: 'The park’s open space can still be visited in light rain, but boating and exposed rides are commonly suspended. This guide does not state a fixed rain policy — check the weather and official warnings before you set out.' },
    { q: 'Is it safe to walk near the lake after rain?', a: 'Take care: stone steps, lawns and the lakeside edge get slippery, and the water rises fast in heavy downpours. Keep to firmer ground, wear grippy shoes, and stay well back from the edge.' },
    { q: 'What should I bring on a rainy day?', a: 'A rain jacket rather than a long umbrella in wind, waterproof shoes with grip, and a plan B built around lake views and short walks.' },
    { q: 'When should I postpone?', a: 'Heavy rain, thunderstorms or official PMD warnings are good reasons to delay. Use the park weather guidance and any official warnings to decide.' },
  ]}
  breadcrumb={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Rainy day guide', href: '/rainy-day-guide/' }]}
  image="/images/rawal-lake-islamabad.jpg"
  related={[
    { label: 'Visitor rules', href: '/visitor-rules/' },
    { label: 'Boating', href: '/boating/' },
    { label: 'Best time to visit', href: '/best-time-to-visit/' },
    { label: 'Weather at the park', href: '/#weather' },
  ]}
>
  <article class="space-y-8">
    <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">Rain does not automatically ruin a Lake View Park visit, but it changes the safety picture. This guide helps you decide and prepare.</p>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Path and edge safety</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">After rain, stone steps, lawns and the lakeside edge get slippery. Keep to firmer ground, wear grippy shoes, and stay well back from the water, which rises fast in heavy downpours.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Activities may pause</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Boating and exposed rides are commonly suspended in rain, thunderstorms or strong wind. A weather forecast does not announce a closure, but assume water activities may be off (see <a class="font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] underline" href="/boating/">boating</a>).</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">What to bring</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 leading-8">
        <li>A rain jacket rather than a long umbrella in wind.</li>
        <li>Waterproof shoes with grip.</li>
        <li>A plan B built around the lake views and covered/short walks.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">When to postpone</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Heavy rain, thunderstorms or official PMD warnings are good reasons to delay. Check <a class="font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] underline" href="/#weather">the park weather guidance</a> and any official warnings before you set out.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Decide before you leave</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">A rainy day is not automatically a cancelled day — the lawns and lake views still work in light rain. But build the plan around safe, firm ground and lake views, keep children supervised near the edge, and postpone if storms or warnings are in play.</p>
    </section>

    <Checklist title="Rainy day checklist" items={[
      'Check the forecast and any official PMD warnings first.',
      'Wear grippy, waterproof shoes and a rain jacket.',
      'Stay on firm ground and well back from the lake edge.',
      'Assume boating and exposed rides may be suspended.',
    ]} />

    <figure>
      <img src="/images/rawal-lake-islamabad.jpg" width="1280" height="960" alt="Calm Rawal Lake view from Lake View Park, Islamabad" class="h-[360px] w-full rounded-[2rem] object-cover card-shadow" loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption><PhotoCredit photo={2} /></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </article>
</SubpageLayout>
